  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "value": "This protein is produced by a bicistronic gene which also produces the MPD6 protein from a non-overlapping reading frame. MPD6 belongs to a group of cryptic antigens without conventional genomic structure. It is encoded by a cryptic open reading frame located in the 3'-untranslated region of MTPN"
    }
   ],
